King's Field strict data comparison for objdiff 3.7.3.

Compare complete initialized sections and BSS extents, preserve ordered
relocation multiplicity and named referents, and include base-only storage
in native reports. Preserve actual MIPS data section referents instead of
resolving them to incidental debug labels. The shared core is built into
both CLI and GUI. Function instruction scoring is unchanged.

